  "description": "WatsonORM is a lightweight and easy to use object-relational mapper (ORM) in C# for .NET Core, .NET Framework, and .NET Standard built on top of DatabaseWrapper.  WatsonORM supports Microsoft SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Sqlite databases.  Refer to other WatsonORM packages if you only need support for a single database type.",
